<title>SINGAPORE: Orchard Parade sees development revenue.</title>
<headline>Orchard Parade sees development revenue.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Orchard Parade Holdings Ltd said on Monday it expects a new residential cum office development to generate annual revenue of Singapore $10 million.</p>
<p>The development, Central Square in central Singapore, is slated for launch in the second half of this year, an Orchard Parade statement said.</p>
<p>In addition to office suites and apartments, the development is expected to include restaurants and retail shops.</p>
<p>Orchard Parade Holdings owns Orchard Parade Hotel and Albert Court Hotel and has rental income from various proerty investments. -- Singapore newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
